{"task_id": "Mbpp/92", "solution": "def is_undulating(number):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a number is undulating. An undulating number alternates between two distinct digits.\n    \"\"\"\n    s = str(abs(number))\n    if len(s) < 2:\n        return False\n\n    first_digit = s[0]\n    second_digit = s[1]\n\n    if first_digit == second_digit:\n        return False\n\n    for i in range(len(s)):\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            if s[i] != first_digit:\n                return False\n        else:\n            if s[i] != second_digit:\n                return False\n    return True"}
