{"task_id": "Mbpp/94", "solution": "def index_minimum(items):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the first value of the tuple with the smallest second value from a list of tuples.\n    Ties are resolved by returning the first encountered item with the minimum value.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_name, min_val = items[0]\n\n    for name, val in items[1:]:\n        if val < min_val:\n            min_name = name\n            min_val = val\n            \n    return min_name"}
