{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, x):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if an element x is the majority element in a sorted array arr of length n.\n    The majority element occurs more than n/2 times.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _first_occurrence(inner_arr, target):\n        \"\"\"Finds the index of the first occurrence of target in inner_arr using binary search.\"\"\"\n        lo, hi = 0, len(inner_arr) - 1\n        res = -1\n        while lo <= hi:\n            mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n            if inner_arr[mid] == target:\n                res = mid\n                hi = mid - 1\n            elif inner_arr[mid] < target:\n                lo = mid + 1\n            else:\n                hi = mid - 1\n        return res\n\n    if not arr:\n        return False\n\n    idx = _first_occurrence(arr, x)\n\n    if idx == -1:\n        return False\n\n    check_index = idx + (n // 2)\n\n    return (check_index < n) and (arr[check_index] == x)"}
