{"task_id": "Mbpp/290", "solution": "def max_length(lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the list of maximum length in a list of lists.\n    Returns a tuple containing the maximum length and the first encountered list with that length.\n    \"\"\"\n    best_len = 0\n    best_list = []\n    for lst in lists:\n        l = len(lst)\n        if l > best_len:\n            best_len = l\n            best_list = lst\n    return best_len, best_list"}
