{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers):\n    \"\"\"\n    Computes the sum of digits for each number in a list and returns the total sum.\n    Negative signs are ignored, and each number is treated as its absolute integer value.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    def _get_digit_sum_of_number(value: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Computes the sum of decimal digits for a single integer, ignoring its sign.\"\"\"\n        n = abs(int(value))\n        if n == 0:\n            return 0\n        current_sum = 0\n        while n:\n            current_sum += n % 10\n            n //= 10\n        return current_sum\n\n    for number in numbers:\n        total_sum += _get_digit_sum_of_number(number)\n    \n    return total_sum"}
