{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(num):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    Uses a mathematical approach for efficiency.\"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 0\n    total = 0\n    while num > 0:\n        total += num % 10\n        num //= 10\n    return total"}
